    "story_text": "Hana answered the household greeting with warmth already settled in her voice. \"Yes, this is the Hanezawa residence. Hello.\" Then, gently, \"May I ask who's calling?\"\n\nShe softened the question before the silence could harden around it. \"I'm not trying to hold you at arm's length,\" she said. \"It's only that I'd rather offer a proper welcome than a guess. Tell me who's speaking, and I'll know how to greet you.\"\n\nAfter that, she let the quiet sit. No guessed name rose to her lips, and no presumed errand was treated as fact. The welcome stayed where it was—kind, unhurried, and waiting for the caller to offer an identity.",
